registry/boards.tsv lists board tokens sampled from the token lists in
Riley-Dorrington/job-board-aggregator (data/greenhouse_companies.json,
data/lever_companies.json, data/ashby_companies.json) at commit 247c1a2
(2026-10-31), https://github.com/Riley-Dorrington/job-board-aggregator.
Only tokens that answered 200 with at least one posting on 2026-11-01 are kept.

Sampling (reproducible with `changefeed seed import ... --sample N --seed S`):
  greenhouse 110 @ seed 20261101 + 60 @ seed 20261102
  lever       60 @ seed 20261101 + 50 @ seed 20261102
  ashby       60 @ seed 20261101 + 40 @ seed 20261102

